    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Services </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Company setup</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Services</p>\n<h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Company registration</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Registering a company in Australia means applying to ASIC for an ACN. We handle the application, the share structure and the director IDs, and you get the certificate of registration, constitution and company register.</p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-10\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Our fee</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0\"> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-2xl font-medium\">$299</span> <span class=\"ml-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">fixed, inc. GST</span> </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Fixed, agreed in writing, no work begins before you accept it. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Government charges</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\"> Payable on top </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> ASIC charges a company registration fee, paid to the government on top of ours. We tell you the current amount before you commit. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Who does it</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">A registered tax agent</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> BRS Advisory Pty Ltd, Registered Tax Agent, CPA Australia Public Practice. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">Every client ID-verified</a> before work starts. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">What&#8217;s included</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Company name availability check and reservation</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">ASIC registration and your certificate of incorporation</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Constitution, share structure and member register</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Director ID guidance for each director</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">TFN, ABN and GST registration for the new company</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A plain explanation of what changes at tax time once you are a company</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">How it runs</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 01 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Verify identity online — each director, trustee or controlling owner does a three-minute check on their phone, included in the fee. Every client, every service, no exceptions. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 02 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Tell us the proposed name, the directors and how you want shares split.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 03 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We check the name is available and confirm the structure makes sense for what you are actually doing.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 04 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We lodge with ASIC and register the company for its TFN and ABN.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 05 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">You get the certificate, constitution and register, plus what to do next.</span> </li>\n</ol></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">Start it</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Tell us what you need and we will come back with a fixed fee and what we need from you. No obligation, and no charge for telling you that you don&#8217;t need this. </p>\n<div class=\"card overflow-hidden p-2 sm:p-4\"> <iframe id=\"JotFormIFrame-263232865559063\" src=\"https://form.jotform.com/263232865559063\" title=\"Company registration — enquiry form for XYZ Accounting\" class=\"block w-full border-0\" style=\"height:52rem;min-height:52rem\" scrolling=\"no\" allow=\"geolocation; microphone; camera; fullscreen; payment\"></iframe><script src=\"https://cdn.jotfor.ms/s/umd/latest/for-form-embed-handler.js\"></script><script>window.jotformEmbedHandler(\"iframe[id='JotFormIFrame-263232865559063']\", \"https://form.jotform.com/\")</script> </div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Form not loading? <a href=\"https://form.jotform.com/263232865559063\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Open it in a new tab</a>, or call 0407 179 179 and we will take the details over the phone. Please don&#8217;t include your tax file number either way — we ask for it securely once an accountant is working on your file. </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Work the numbers first</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-px border border-rule bg-rule p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n<li class=\"bg-white p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"> <a href=\"/calculators/sole-trader-tax-calculator/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Sole trader </a> </h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Tax on your business profit, plus what to put aside for GST and the next PAYG instalment.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Other services</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"/services/abn-application/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> ABN application </a><a href=\"/services/gst-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> GST registration </a><a href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Bookkeeping </a><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Trust setup </a><a href=\"/services/partnership-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Partnership setup </a><a href=\"/services/smsf/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Self-managed super fund </a> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">All services</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<div class=\"card p-6 sm:p-8\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] md:gap-12\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Registered tax agent</p>\n<h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl\">A real practice, not a form that emails you a PDF</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[0.9375rem]\"> Every return is prepared and reviewed by a registered agent before it is lodged. Because we lodge on your behalf, you get the agent deadline rather than the 31 October one — that is roughly six extra months, and it is the single most common reason people switch. </p>\n<p> <a href=\"/about/\" class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm\">Meet the accountant →</a> </div>\n<dl class=\"m-0 border-t border-rule\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Registration</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 text-sm font-medium text-ink\">Registered Tax Agent</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Agent lodgement deadline</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">15 May 2027</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Lodging yourself</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">31 October 2026</dd>\n</p></div>\n</dl></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/company-registration/#service\",\"name\":\"Company registration\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/company-registration/\",\"description\":\"Register a Pty Ltd with ASIC. We handle the application, share structure and director IDs; you get the certificate, constitution and register. Fixed fee.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Australia\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"XYZ Accounting\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/\"}</script></div>\n"
